  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allow a single C# script on an avatar. This would make it much easier for things like custom animations and cool interactions. Some ways to prevent abuse: 1: use an algorithm, or even an AI to search for offending signatures and/or namespaces/classes/methods, and either remove them, or what would be safer, allow only certain ones. 2: require approval by a team who reviews them first. If requests get out of hand, allow only 1 script per entire account. If they wanted more than one script on any of their avatars, they would need to delete their current one. Loading the script can be achieved with compiled DLLs and reflection on any Windows platform.",
